    "description": "The Hotel Loyalty Points Expiry Query API allows users to retrieve information regarding the expiration status of loyalty points accrued in hotel loyalty programs. This endpoint serves as a valuable resource for guests and loyalty program members to understand when their points will expire, encouraging timely usage and maintaining customer engagement. Typical consumers of this API may include hotel loyalty program administrators and app developers integrating point management insights into their applications. By providing up-to-date expiry information, this API supports informed decision-making for frequent travelers.",
